                                                "sense_id": "029d810c-2c91-35e9-9452-b67be7b8249b",
                                                "text": "For my birthday I received two bouquets."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3968d666-4bc2-3c61-ac87-79064f116079",
                                        "entry_id": "a8fe649b-d9cb-3a42-9975-3f657807e30c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A decoratively arranged bunch of something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "809e6df3-7c46-4bbf-8884-1dc5c0f09925",
                                                "sense_id": "3968d666-4bc2-3c61-ac87-79064f116079",
                                                "text": "Each table was adorned with a bouquet of giant balloons."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed98cf0b-f247-4de1-85cc-7d406ebbd892",
                                                "sense_id": "3968d666-4bc2-3c61-ac87-79064f116079",
                                                "text": "Aunt Cass rearranged the bouquet of spoons in the little vase on the table."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "061a2339-f144-3a90-aa49-5b69f55bf6cf",
                                        "entry_id": "a8fe649b-d9cb-3a42-9975-3f657807e30c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The scent of a particular wine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7867aba9-4c77-4951-abb5-b422b6d760d4",
                                                "sense_id": "061a2339-f144-3a90-aa49-5b69f55bf6cf",
                                                "text": "This Bordeaux has an interesting bouquet."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1190be53-8961-3584-b050-660818db6fbb",
                                        "entry_id": "a8fe649b-d9cb-3a42-9975-3f657807e30c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The middle note of a perfume."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8989de69-8c32-4fbf-9474-d9970d65d0af",
                                                "sense_id": "1190be53-8961-3584-b050-660818db6fbb",
                                                "text": "The remarkable flower bouquet lasts for hours until it dissolves into a sweet vanilla smell."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b4cd0ec9-d698-3b84-aae1-ec0fde0a7ac1",
                                        "entry_id": "a8fe649b-d9cb-3a42-9975-3f657807e30c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A compliment or expression of praise."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "676b61e6-56d8-49e2-8de6-ae3a070d07cd",
                                                "sense_id": "b4cd0ec9-d698-3b84-aae1-ec0fde0a7ac1",
                                                "text": "Since his early death in 1953, a cult, small and select, has grown up around him […]. This coterie maintains that Burns was a writer of near transcendent genius […] whose first novel received enormous bouquets from the critics but who was hounded to death by those same critics when they learned he was a fag."
                                            }
